name hepunits
category Package
revision 54758
shortdesc A set of units useful in high energy physics applications
longdesc Hepunits is a LaTeX package built on the SIunits package which
longdesc adds a collection of useful HEP units to the existing SIunits
longdesc set. These include the energy units \MeV, \GeV, \TeV and the
longdesc derived momentum and mass units \MeVoverc, \MeVovercsq and so
longdesc on.
